<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0B1220', padding: '20px 64px' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 100, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'flex-end', justifyContent: 'space-between', paddingBottom: 18 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF7' }}>技术原理速览</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.55, letterSpacing: 1 }}>全篇只在这一页讲技术名词，看完就回到人话</Text>
        </Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontFamily: 'Consolas', color: '#4FE0B0', opacity: 0.8 }}>技术说明</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 500, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 320, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between', padding: 22, background: 'rgba(79,224,176,0.08)', border: '1px solid rgba(79,224,176,0.35)', borderRadius: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 26, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF7', lineHeight: 1.35 }}>技术名词<br />都放这一页</Text>
                <Box style={{ height: 3, width: 80, background: 'linear-gradient(135deg, #4FE0B0 0%, #2E9E8F 100%)', borderRadius: 2 }} />
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.72, lineHeight: 1.6 }}>前面讲的都是怎么用；这一页交代它是怎么做出来的，好让评委知道这不是"调了个接口"就完事。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 6, paddingTop: 14, borderTop: '1px solid rgba(232,238,247,0.14)' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.6, lineHeight: 1.5 }}>下一页还有一处技术设计要交代，之后就回到产品本身。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 14 }}>
            <Box style={{ height: 132, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8, padding: 18, background: 'rgba(232,238,247,0.04)', border: '1px solid rgba(232,238,247,0.10)', borderRadius: 12 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4FE0B0' }}>用什么做的</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.75, lineHeight: 1.55 }}>桌面外壳用 Tauri 2，界面用 Vue 3 + TypeScript，核心逻辑（定时、弹窗、锁屏关机、本机那套规则）用 Rust 写。同一套代码出 Windows 和 macOS 两个版本。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ height: 132, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8, padding: 18, background: 'rgba(232,238,247,0.04)', border: '1px solid rgba(232,238,247,0.10)', borderRadius: 12 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4FE0B0' }}>一句话怎么变成提醒</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.75, lineHeight: 1.55 }}>联网时交给网上的大模型去理解；没网就用软件自带的一套规则（本机规则引擎）。不管走哪条路，结果都要先过一遍校验才写进数据。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ height: 132, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 8, padding: 18, background: 'rgba(232,238,247,0.04)', border: '1px solid rgba(232,238,247,0.10)', borderRadius: 12 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#4FE0B0' }}>数据怎么存</Text>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.75, lineHeight: 1.55 }}>就存在你自己电脑的一个文件里。写入时先写临时文件、成功后再替换（原子写入）——写到一半断电，原来的数据也不会坏。没有服务器，也没有要你注册的东西。</Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 60, flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.42 }}>知歇 ZhiXie · V1.0.0</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontFamily: 'Consolas', color: '#E8EEF7', opacity: 0.42 }}>15 / 18</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
